{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Combine one scoped website, an optional JSON OpenAPI comparison and selected finalized Base evidence into one bounded release brief. Separate provenance and missing/conflicting evidence; a release-label mention never proves deployment or causality. One fixed workflow charge; internal steps never create separate customer charges. First URL source use seeds state in this same operation; compatible source_watch_id adopts retained public Register evidence for a genuine first comparison with original scope/time, not ownership. For continuation, later observations use returned owned observation_id. State expires seven days after creation; reads/writes never extend it. Auth: authorized native-USDC x402 v2 on Base, enabled MPP, or an eligible prepaid key plus exact tariff 5 and max_credits. Ordinary unpaid calls return a challenge, not execution. Persist original input, proof and recovery token before submission; exact replay returns retained results without fresh work or another charge. Choose evidence detail before authorization. No free-trial or automatic paid fallback. 0.040 USDC or 16 credits. Limits and scope are authoritative, not a complete audit or compatibility guarantee. The same fixed x402 service price may also be paid in native Circle USDC on Solana Mainnet (solana:5eykt4UsFv8P8NJdTREpY1vzqKqZKvdp), when advertised by the unpaid challenge. Explicitly select one accepted network and pin its mint, merchant, amount and sponsored fee payer before signing. Solana payers need no Base wallet; Standalone native Solana MPP solana/charge is also advertised; its client pays a separately authorized SOL network fee, with no server fee sponsorship. Prepaid MPP funding remains Base-only. Payment network does not change the observed chain: blockchain products still inspect finalized Base. Solana delivery requires finalized matching USDC evidence. Persist the original network, resource, input, proof and private recovery capability; never switch networks or authorize a replacement after uncertainty.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"oneOf":[{"not":{"anyOf":[{"required":["source_watch_id"]},{"required":["observation_id"]}]},"required":["url","onchain"]},{"not":{"anyOf":[{"required":["url"]},{"required":["observation_id"]},{"required":["scope"]}]},"required":["source_watch_id","onchain"]},{"not":{"anyOf":[{"required":["url"]},{"required":["source_watch_id"]},{"required":["scope"]},{"required":["api_url"]},{"required":["onchain"]}]},"required":["observation_id"]}],"properties":{"api_url":{"description":"Optional explicit JSON OpenAPI source for a new cross-domain identity; no link discovery. Saved observation_id freezes this URL too. source_watch_id adopts only the website; this API source seeds separately.","format":"uri","maxLength":4096,"pattern":"^[Hh][Tt][Tt][Pp][Ss]:\\/\\/","type":"string"},"compare_to":{"default":"previous","description":"Default previous compares with the latest successful workflow observation; baseline compares with its original seed. Seeding is one paid workflow operation and reports no comparison, never a second internal charge.","enum":["previous","baseline"],"type":"string"},"detail":{"default":"compact","description":"Default compact: at most 20 evidence items per section. Expanded allows at most 200 document findings or 100 Base events and retains raw validated logs/getter ABI details within the same fixed work/output ceiling. Counts and omitted-evidence warnings remain explicit.","enum":["compact","expanded"],"type":"string"},"json_array_keys":{"description":"Optional bounded explicit JSON record identities for the website/JSON component only; not API or chain data. Same validation as Smart Diff; omit for index comparison. Comparison policy does not alter source ownership, saved hashes or paid recovery identity.","items":{"